{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H33–H35、M22及原解释均支持安宁真实发生后开始消逝、他因此舍不得，以及安宁无法维持时身体先紧起来，所以刚得到的好可能留不住这一因果有据可循。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H10、H33、H34支持真实快乐与温暖正在成为过去，M1也明确支持所求仍能带来欣喜和活气、却尚未真正有着落，因此感情重新活跃并不代表问题已经解决。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H18、H20、H21、H22、M20及原解释均支持继续加力不能消除失去的可能、坚定不能保证所珍惜之物不变，以及紧张积累后由行动转为僵住等待的因果。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"H15、H34和M15支持过去的亲近真实发生、温暖正在成为过去且无法原样保存，但没有依据说明那份熟悉曾经如此自然，因此把自然性作为现在更容易感到舍不得的原因，增加了未经支持的解释。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cfbff065-ab1a-4d78-8b60-476e710c1902", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T134201905230Z", "elapsed_seconds": 293.281, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:46:55.187391+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "544f850038cfc39b61a3c261f86ca5fae24aec079e9bbf9dafaedf7c699fcdb5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\